What:		/proc/game_opt/cpu_load
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only ColorOS 14 GameOpt CPU-load telemetry derived from the
		OnePlus 9R Android 14 implementation.  One line is emitted for
		each possible CPU using this exact grammar:

		CPU:<cpu> busy_pct:<busy> util_pct:<util>

		busy_pct is the non-idle percentage since the previous read.
		util_pct weights active time by the current CPU frequency as a
		percentage of that CPU policy's maximum frequency.  Reading the
		file resets the sampling interval.  Stage 9E adds no writable
		GameOpt control nodes.
Users:		vendor.oplus.hardware.gameopt-service
